## TL;DR Checklist

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| **✅ Use PMTiles** for any *static* raster or vector basemap you want to host on S3, Cloudflare R2, GitHub Pages, etc. |
| **❌ Do NOT store** live bus positions in a PMTiles file – you’d have to rebuild and re-upload the whole archive every 30 s. |
| **✅ Choose** a dynamic source for the bus layer: |
|   • **GeoJSON polling** (simple, good for < 5 k points) |
|   • **Dynamic vector-tile server** (Martin, t-rex, tileserver-gl) for larger fleets |
|   • **Web
